sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title HackMatch — US-003: User Login and Session Management — Login and Authorization Sequence
    actor User
    participant UI as React Login + MFA Gate
    participant Firebase as Firebase Authentication
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant OTP as US-004 OTP Service

    User->>UI: Submit email and password
    UI->>UI: Validate required fields and email format
    alt Invalid input
        UI-->>User: Field errors, preserve entered values
    else Valid form
        UI->>Firebase: signInWithEmailAndPassword
        alt Invalid credentials or Firebase throttles
            Firebase--xUI: Generic credential or too-many-requests error
            UI-->>User: Non-enumerating error or retry guidance
        else Primary authentication succeeds
            Firebase-->>UI: Firebase user + pre-MFA ID token
            UI->>API: GET /api/auth/account-status with Bearer token
            API->>Firebase: Verify ID token with revocation checking
            API->>DB: Read participant suspension state
            alt Disabled or suspended account
                API-->>UI: 403 ACCOUNT_DISABLED / ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED
                UI->>Firebase: Sign out locally
                UI-->>User: Account-blocked guidance, no MFA/session
            else Active account
                API-->>UI: 200 active
                UI->>API: POST /api/auth/mfa/challenge with Bearer token
                API->>OTP: Create and email current challenge
                OTP-->>UI: Challenge identifier and masked email
                UI-->>User: Request 6-digit OTP
                User->>UI: Submit OTP
                UI->>API: POST /api/auth/mfa/verify
                API->>OTP: Atomically validate/consume challenge
                alt OTP invalid, expired, locked, or unavailable
                    API-->>UI: Explicit error, protected content remains closed
                else OTP accepted
                    API->>Firebase: Set mfa_auth_time custom claim
                    API-->>UI: Verification success
                    UI->>Firebase: Force-refresh ID token
                    UI->>UI: MfaGate requires claim for current auth_time
                    alt Claim missing or stale
                        UI-->>User: Keep OTP gate, no protected content
                    else Current MFA claim present
                        UI->>API: Protected request via authFetch<br/>Authorization: Bearer current ID token
                        API->>Firebase: Verify token and revocation
                        API->>DB: Require active account, current MFA, and allowed role
                        alt Expired, revoked, suspended, wrong role, or missing MFA
                            API-->>UI: Explicit 401/403 denial
                        else Authorized
                            API-->>UI: Protected response
                            UI-->>User: Render authorized function
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over UI,API: Current browser path uses Firebase bearer tokens.<br/>It does not call POST /api/auth/session to create the optional hardened cookie.

